NAME
        headers - show the headers you are carrying

SYNOPSIS
        headers | headers all
        headers <layer>

DESCRIPTION
        The status command shows your current status, which means that you
        see all data you are currently consisting of. Its a bit like looking
        at yourself.
         
OPTIONS
	[none] or all - list all your headers

	<layer>       - a string that specifies which layer you want to list
                        the headers for. Possible strings are: 

                                physical aka datalink aka 1  
                        
                                network aka 2
                        
                                transport aka 3
                        
                                application aka 4
                        
                                data

SEE ALSO
	status
